WEBVTT

00:00:00.533 --> 00:00:03.733
You've completed an ultrasound scan,
during a busy night shift.

00:00:05.633 --> 00:00:08.133
But the right supervisor
isn't always there.

00:00:08.133 --> 00:00:12.600
They might be working different days,
different shifts, or at another hospital.

00:00:14.133 --> 00:00:16.767
And before you know it,
another week has passed.

00:00:16.767 --> 00:00:20.733
Your scans shouldn't be forgotten,
simply because your rotas don't match.

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:27.633
Wavelength helps you record
each scan while it's fresh.

00:00:27.633 --> 00:00:29.267
Then arrange the right review,

00:00:29.267 --> 00:00:32.233
without you both needing to
be there at the same time.

00:00:32.867 --> 00:00:35.133
Open your logbook and choose the scan.

00:00:35.133 --> 00:00:38.067
Record your findings and
how you were supervised,

00:00:38.067 --> 00:00:40.600
add an image once identifiers are removed,

00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:43.300
and it can count towards
your chosen pathway.

00:00:44.867 --> 00:00:47.400
Then choose a supervisor
Wavelength has verified.

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:51.633
We check their registration where it applies,
review their ultrasound credentials,

00:00:51.633 --> 00:00:53.767
and approve them only for specific areas.

00:00:54.867 --> 00:00:57.267
Send your review request in a few taps.

00:00:57.267 --> 00:00:59.733
It waits on your supervisor's dashboard.

00:01:01.933 --> 00:01:05.933
When they're next available,
on another shift or at another site,

00:01:05.933 --> 00:01:09.833
they review each scan, rate the images,
add feedback, and sign.

00:01:12.867 --> 00:01:16.800
You see the outcome in your logbook,
with a code anyone can verify.

00:01:16.800 --> 00:01:21.667
Directly supervised scans and formal
assessments still follow your pathway's rules.

00:01:22.500 --> 00:01:26.867
Every review moves your training forward,
and your evidence stays organised,

00:01:26.867 --> 00:01:28.900
ready to export for your portfolio.

00:01:30.500 --> 00:01:31.367
Recording scans,

00:01:31.367 --> 00:01:35.700
requesting reviews and tracking your
progress are all part of the free logbook.

00:01:36.400 --> 00:01:38.767
And when you're ready
to build your skills,

00:01:38.767 --> 00:01:42.033
our hands-on courses and tailored
training are here to help.

00:01:45.667 --> 00:01:46.833
Wavelength.

00:01:46.833 --> 00:01:47.700
Tune in.

00:01:47.700 --> 00:01:49.100
Gain clarity.
